# U62 — Local provider and model deprecation review

Scope: review deprecation behavior for local providers and locally installed
models only. Do not query or call Anthropic endpoints, use remote Compliance
APIs, or add cloud catalog entries.

Before changing code, inventory local provider identifiers and their actual
runtime support. Make removal/retirement behavior explicit and opt-in where
configuration is involved. Add behavior tests for every supported path and
record unsupported local models without inventing compatibility.

Run the focused tests, touched-file lint, and full suite. Keep all existing
gates intact. Update the changelog, roadmap, checklist, implementation
checklist, README, pyproject version, versioned upgrade note, and the next
cycle prompt. Stop before commit, push, approval, or merge.
